res/errors |\n141\t| Node initial and final | `clj -M:cljs -m shadow.cljs.devtools.cli compile test --config-merge '{:ns-regexp \"^yang\\\\.clojure-callsite-test$\"}'` | 40 tests, 508 assertions, 0 failures/errors; all eight snapshots match |\n142\t| Dart battery | `bb src/dev/cljd_agg.clj --only yang.clojure-callsite-test` | 40 registered tests: 39 pass, 1 fails (cohort); Flutter does not report an assertion tally |\n143\t| Dart isolated reproduction | `bb src/dev/cljd_agg.clj --only yang.clojure-callsite-test/portable-replay-cohort-test` | 1 registered test, fails reproducibly; actual artifacts captured |\n144\t| Jolt/J2 | `bb src/dev/jolt_j2_lane.clj core --only '^yang.clojure-callsite-test$'` | exit 1 at manifest; 0 Jolt child tests executed, no digests produced |\n145\t\n146\tThe JVM battery preceded the additional diagnostic-only artifact fields and B/S\n147\tpreparation arity; the final focused JVM check and final Node battery include\n148\tthose changes. The isolated Dart reproduction includes the diagnostic capture.\n149\tThe original Dart attempt was a toolchain sandbox refusal (Flutter SDK cache\n150\twrites denied), not a test result. The retry with cache access compiled and ran,\n151\tand then exposed the real divergence. No full-suite claim is made.\n152\t\n153\tTDD evidence: the initial empty snapshot expectation fails on JVM (1 failed\n154\tassertion out of 11); subsequent recorded expectations pass. Adding per-format\n155\tprovenance caused another empty-expectation red before the final recording.\n156\tThe J2 inclusion assertion initially fails because cc4 is absent; inclusion is\n157\tnow present in `included` and in `check-manifest!`'s bare inventory. The four\n158\tother namespace omissions are independently reproduced using HEAD's original\n159\t`included` and original `check-manifest!` definitions (saved baseline script).\n160\t\n161\t## Legacy behavior and refusal inventory\n162\t\n163\tThe existing battery passed `published-instruction-prove