d is claimed.\n221\t\n222\t## Remote approval review and scope\n223\t\n224\tRead-only load checks reached both designated hosts, both idle relative to core\n225\tcount; no Dart lane was running. A request to create\n226\t`~/ci/datomworld-cc4-r2-node` on jupiter from the repository already there was\n227\trejected by automatic approval review. Its stated reason: copying the entire\n228\tprivate repository and mutating the remote host required explicit authorization\n229\tfor that specific operation, beyond host testing. The clone creation did not\n230\texecute. An asynchronous approval question is pending. Local focused gates\n231\tcontinued as the permitted alternative; no transfer workaround was attempted.\n232\tNow that a compiler divergence has triggered STOP, no remote acceptance or\n233\tbudget work will proceed in this round regardless of that pending approval.\n234\t\n235\tOnly the two authorized tracked test/manifest files changed. All other new\n236\tartifacts are in the permitted fixture and collab locations. The compiler source\n237\thash is recorded below solely as an input pin; it is unchanged from HEAD.\n238\t`git diff --check` passes. Final kondo reports **0 errors, 1 pre-existing unused\n239\t`yin.repl.query` require warning**, exit 2 due to warnings. No commit/stage/push.\n240\t\n241\t## SHA-256 pins at delivery\n242\t\n243\t| File | SHA-256 |\n244\t|---|---|\n245\t| `test/yang/clojure_callsite_test.cljc` | `feead0c05783e09e725c6786c2b3d8dd6cc32eca875ccc9e2c5fc2ff466ff607` |\n246\t| `src/dev/jolt_j2_lane.clj` | `e71dced27962666119f2a9c7ed70664ffcac820161b3ef4b5b654d9ae301bbca` |\n247\t| `test/resources/yang/clojure/cc4-replay-snapshots.edn` | `5f28913f56b1b001aa11d4ba8ef6216df334fcadaf7ba096b2992681007a959f` |\n248\t| `test/resources/yang/clojure/cc4-replay-jvm.cbor` | `4200ab187d04833f425de5dfd30685113841ffd58e62d1aacb11946123ababc2` |\n249\t| `test/resources/yang/clojure/cc4-replay-jvm-affected.edn` | `0b7ebab6bb5e3062876020bce10161c4e807786786fe8